            ["Частная производная", r"$\dfrac{\partial f}{\partial x_i} = \lim\limits_{\Delta x_i \to 0}\dfrac{\Delta_{x_i} f}{\Delta x_i}$"],
            ["Градиент", r"$\nabla f = \Big(\dfrac{\partial f}{\partial x_1};\ \ldots;\ \dfrac{\partial f}{\partial x_n}\Big)$"],
            ["Производная по направлению", r"$D_{\mathbf{u}} f = \lim\limits_{t \to 0}\dfrac{f(\mathbf{x} + t\mathbf{u}) - f(\mathbf{x})}{t} = \nabla f\cdot\mathbf{u}$ ($|\mathbf{u}| = 1$, $f$ дифференцируема)"],
