        ("p", r"<b>Misol: $f(x) = x^2$ ixtiyoriy nuqtada.</b> $\Delta f = (x + \Delta x)^2 - x^2 = 2x\,\Delta x + \Delta x^2$; $\frac{\Delta f}{\Delta x} = 2x + \Delta x$; $f'(x) = \lim\limits_{\Delta x \to 0}(2x + \Delta x) = 2x$. $x = 1$ da $2$, $x = 3$ da $6$ hosil bo‘ladi — yuqoridagi jadvallardagidek."),
        ("h3", "O‘zgaruvchi harfi muhim emas: $\\frac{df}{dx}$, $\\frac{df}{dz}$ va $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}$"),
